atlas/wisconsin/douglas-county"],["ARC or PLC in Douglas County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/douglas-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 45% of normal in September to October and 40% of normal in October to November 2025. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 31354 got 53% of normal that year.</p>"}
